    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nKNOCK, CO. MAYO\r\n\r\nPRIME DEVELOPMENT SITE\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE IN ONE LOT OR INDIVIDUAL SITES\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this prime development opportunity situated on the outskirts of Knock Village, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nThe lands have been fully developed and levelled into high-quality building ground and are being offered for sale subject to the proposed purchasers obtaining planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises c.2.01 acres in total with extensive frontage onto the main road together with additional frontage onto a side road, offering excellent accessibility and future development potential.\r\n\r\nServices including public water, public sewerage and electricity are all available adjacent to the property.\r\n\r\nFolio Numbers:\r\n\r\n• MY6145F – c.1.25 acres\r\n• MY55205F – c.0.76 acres\r\n\r\nTotal Area: c.2.01 Acres\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• Prime development opportunity\r\n• Available in one lot or individual sites\r\n• c.2.01 acres in total\r\n• Extensive road frontage\r\n• Frontage onto two roads\r\n• Levelled and prepared building ground\r\n• Public water available\r\n• Public sewerage available\r\n• Electricity passing the property\r\n• Excellent future potential subject to planning\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Situated on the outskirts of Knock Village\r\n• Walking distance to village amenities\r\n• Close to Knock Shrine\r\n• Approx. 10 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n• Easy access to Ballyhaunis, Claremorris and Kiltimagh\r\n• Excellent connectivity to the N17 Galway–Sligo route\r\n\r\nGuide Price:\r\n\r\n€100,000 for the entire c.2.01 acre holding\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\n094 9362216 | 086 2130723\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      },
